<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz W seeks main mkt spot Aug 4.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz W seeks main mkt spot Aug 4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Elektromontaz Warszawa SA has proposed the Warsaw bourse that its shares be transferred to the main market from the parallel floor on August 4, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday the bourse approved such a transfer.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
